# Enforce LF line endings on every platform — prettier/eslint rules fail on
# CRLF checkouts (as seen with default core.autocrlf=true on Windows, where
# `npm run lint` reports "Delete ␍" for every file).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary